      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "I hink, Im fine for now. I will try to keep myself focus on different things",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
      "identity": "a53043c19b52522eab105e967e136ce064d194a05d531f1bf81194d990110d69"
    },
    "p16/esc915:25": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "esc915",
      "session_rank": 1,
      "turn_index": 25,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "and try to chat a bit more at leaat with my family",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
      "identity": "791e3121c5a0ffcbf2143469c73c05edebcb8c4b7aafe580a32589babe62b0a9"
    },
    "p16/esc915:26": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "esc915",
      "session_rank": 1,
      "turn_index": 26,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "Good bye?",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
      "identity": "f0491712c7bd22ca06c009fe96ff12e696f5ee9669a84fd23e74143013032bb0"
    },
    "p16/esc915:27": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "esc915",
      "session_rank": 1,
      "turn_index": 27,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "Good bye!",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
      "identity": "a9156e72dc7bd221f6e71b22fd0073e3086f86d23ee39b60a6d65af84ce56c8e"
    },
    "p16/esc915:3": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "esc915",
      "session_rank": 1,
      "turn_index": 3,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "and since then im feeling really sad",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
      "identity": "13f12e1e58cb1d80ec2a9af32d278841eca8dfa000ed2a2eca050decbc42078f"
    },
    "p16/esc915:4": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "esc915",
      "session_rank": 1,
      "turn_index": 4,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "It is natural to feel sad when someone you care about dies.",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
      "identity": "dca7eca9841807c0d90761cbc8e473edd1ba7703c75733fc5f928d7d0f44c4f1"
    },
    "p16/esc915:5": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "esc915",
      "session_rank": 1,
      "turn_index": 5,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "IS there something I can do to feel better?",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
      "identity": "f50184235d0ae24a77fe0991ad859dc2f87904f098d5671649bb1b67881f3549"
    },
    "p16/esc915:6": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "esc915",
      "session_rank": 1,
      "turn_index": 6,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "Are you with family?   Sometimes it helps to be with others who are grieving?",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
      "identity": "1b6130e08f1eb184159ab51312023578fedfcfebab0f9e19ae2e264d785a8b48"
    },
    "p16/esc915:7": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "esc915",
      "session_rank": 1,
      "turn_index": 7,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "No, I live alone, my family lives in another state",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
      "identity": "1ababdcb1e1a819f2b4f6e06c6f83bc529f97c6ab39ddf56d3959ed2144aaa9e"
    },
    "p16/esc915:8": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "esc915",
      "session_rank": 1,
      "turn_index": 8,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "Being by yourself is rough after a death.    Can you talk with your family by phone?   Do you have a friend who has gone through a similar loss?",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
      "identity": "eaa10a54b5051f8dde589c7d237ee619102e783046a88dcb64109deeadbfd6cc"
    },
    "p16/esc915:9": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "esc915",
      "session_rank": 1,
      "turn_index": 9,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "I feel like everybody is in their own bussines and have no time to hear my complains",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
      "identity": "69f03f2cf979add11d1d9c0ea62a31f690a6cab25101dd88c6be570c72fa4ea8"
    },
    "p16/p16_conv_1:0": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "p16_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 0,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "Hi Amanda, it's good to see you online. How have you been doing lately?",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-25",
      "identity": "c8ee65186740a35c3fed57b06d5bcf26301312b8202631e51b6d93fb9fd72d48"
    },
    "p16/p16_conv_1:1": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "p16_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 1,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "Hey! I've been feeling a bit off after attending my aunt's memorial service last week.",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-25",
      "identity": "5eddbb347fb7653712d565948fb7013b568d4c499817ffcb562336dd5040adaa"
    },
    "p16/p16_conv_1:10": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "p16_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 10,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "That's a great step forward. How does it feel to have taken that initiative?",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-25",
      "identity": "5611ff66cd8cdb9b2c2336fbc91ee6dc42f6a0bd7836b78c41f99d8ee8e829ce"
    },
    "p16/p16_conv_1:11": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "p16_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 11,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "A little reassuring, honestly. But there's still this nagging feeling of having missed out on so much with them.",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-25",
      "identity": "79524b632959fd1c608ebd1c6f17a991299f5a9af1648045fb0a2cfc0fa6fa2f"
    },
    "p16/p16_conv_1:12": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "p16_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 12,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "It's natural to feel that way, but it's important to give yourself grace. Every relationship has its own timeline.",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-25",
      "identity": "3efd2965307595e84ac9dc157a3cb03e6ddb1cfb9669efa984bf66b902164059"
    },
    "p16/p16_conv_1:13": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "p16_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 13,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "You're right. I guess I should focus on making the most of the present.",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-25",
      "identity": "181423df3af64a57276bdbc61876a75d7b69deee7a589cd5d3818125740d36e7"
    },
    "p16/p16_conv_1:2": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "p16_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 2,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "I'm sorry to hear that. It must have been an emotional experience for you.",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-25",
      "identity": "1637a12e7ddceea28062b1a397e09a6ee0af4853a02b5d5f419cb5b302d92957"
    },
    "p16/p16_conv_1:3": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "p16_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 3,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "Yeah, it really was. Not only because we were saying goodbye, but also because I got to see so many relatives I hadn't seen in years.",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-25",
      "identity": "1f7ff38ac4d7fdbc31f7135029fbc20651271805da0862b48e133fb62f4704a3"
    },
    "p16/p16_conv_1:4": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "p16_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 4,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "That sounds like it brought up a lot of feelings. How did that affect you?",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-25",
      "identity": "f4e85bd04dcae1e95e0f38ec3703e31b9b22f27d9d80aaeccf3b48931a710097"
    },
    "p16/p16_conv_1:5": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "p16_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 5,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "It was bittersweet. On one hand, it was wonderful to reconnect, but on the other hand, it made me realize how distant I've become from them.",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-25",
      "identity": "0c80080b68b56dce63ace3de19b1b39122df999fee62b4703b70402422763f49"
    },
    "p16/p16_conv_1:6": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "p16_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 6,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "It sounds like you're processing a mix of emotions—grief and perhaps some regret?",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-25",
      "identity": "7866951342f93d5c96eb163bfb10757a969ce4c9afd59f3de77b28bee02992d1"
    },
    "p16/p16_conv_1:7": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "p16_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 7,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "Exactly. I feel guilty for not staying in touch more. It was strange talking about memories with people I used to be so close to.",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-25",
      "identity": "2630f56193aea8935d45bb9137a8b6445b2dd1a4f025a49cd402e59f2167a0b9"
    },
    "p16/p16_conv_1:8": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "p16_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 8,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "That's understandable. Guilt can be hard to shake off, but reconnecting at the memorial could be a new beginning.",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-25",
      "identity": "648894554af27e1e836370e0c88bf89cfcee4742a3d983f09f33f408be2ebcee"
    },
    "p16/p16_conv_1:9": {
      "owner_id": "p16",
      "session_id": "p16_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 9,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "I hope so. I exchanged numbers with a few of them and promised to keep in touch.",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-25",
      "identity": "28aac6601ae4b59f4ccb21ef1b7deb7ab7f0cd1012a5ba22e7628bf09cc07115"
    }
  },
